        <li>They have not heard the real numbers on EV design pay, robotics roles, or design-engineer growth paths.</li>
        <li>They worry the backup plan is vague, not concrete.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--teal">
      <div class="compare-card__label">What actually reassures them</div>
