        <li>A realistic income timeline, including any slower early years, not just the headline final salary.</li>
        <li>One small proof step you have already taken, like a mock GATE score, a modelled CAD part, or an informational conversation with someone already on that path.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

